# Elite morning send schedule

Reports and Slack posts run **Sunday through Thursday only** (10:00 AM Israel).
**Never** generate, publish, or Slack-post on **Friday** or **Saturday**.

| Run day | Report | Slack |
|---------|--------|-------|
| **Sunday** | Weekend summary — prior **Thu–Sat** compiled | Weekend link only |
| **Monday–Thursday** | Daily summary — **yesterday** | Daily link only |
| **Friday / Saturday** | Skip | No send |

Slack follows the same calendar: Sun–Thu only; Fri/Sat silent.
Order when sending: generate → git Pages publish → Slack.
